# Python environments and caches
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.py[cod]

# Secrets and local configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
**/.secrets/
**/.leeway-vault/
**/*credential*
**/*secret*
**/*private-key*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12

